  "hero": "/work/uploads/Jenjphoto_hollywood_unlocked-4481.webp",
  "description": "Supernerd was hired to create the brand for an at the time Instagram Blog called \"Hollywood Unlocked\". This blog was going to allow celebrites to have their prespectives and sides heard by leveraging the relationships of the CEO Jason Lee who knew these people personally. Becoming the Art Director of the brand he crafted the visuals from IG social content, to TV shows, to Podcasts, to Awards show. Jump in to see some of our favorite projects for Hollywood Unlocked...",
  "pieces": [
    {
      "title": "Hollywood Unlocked Brand Creation",
      "hero": "/work/uploads/screen-shot-2026-06-12-at-4.19.45-am.webp",
      "video": "https://customer-jo6j16htmygzl1y3.cloudflarestream.com/affabec1262ffba878d9ace0b28c8605/manifest/video.m3u8",
      "no_video": false,
      "description": "Before Hollywood Unlocked became a brand it was just an idea and a brain child. We were approached in 2015 with the idea of the brand and a working logo that did not work. We took it from a pink home made looking brand to a brand that has timeless branding. We connected the O and the U of the words to create an unlocked padlock one that carries over in the secondary logo and changed the colorway from pink to baby blue, black, white and gray. We launched the brand August 13th 2015.",
